st Letter.\nYou have been assigned the task 'Lost Letter'.\nFind evidence about this treasonous plot 0/1 - Valdeholm\nFor this step, you need to loot a Sealed Letter (identifies as \"Sealed with a symbol of the Lorekeepers of Valdeholm\"), which drops from trash in Valdeholm.\nDeliver 1 Sealed Letter to Fergarin 0/1 - Valdeholm\nYour efforts have proven Fergarin's suspicions to be correct. The letter you recovered was sealed by a lorekeeper's seal. However, the letter was unsigned, relying on some previous understanding as to who the parties involved are. From the information in the letter, it seems obvious that it was intended for some Drakkin officer in the far south east, probably in the place they call Direwind. Fergarin thanks you for your efforts and hopes that he can find someone to [complete the task].\nYour standing with Wraithguard Leadership got better. (+50)\nReward: Experience and Progression\nCompleting this task opens up the next task in the series.\n**Submitted by:** Jakobe",
