 with the Drakkin is to find the dragon-kin that the lorekeeper was in contact with and beat the information out of him. Certainly this is something you can do? Go to the place called Direwind [zone=441] and kill the Drakkin there until you find Telgrith, the Black Legion Captain [npc=23186] and kill him too, though not before he gives you the name of the one that he has been dealing with.\n1\\. Kill the Drakkin that is plotting with the traitors 0/1 (Direwind Cliffs)\nTelgrith, Black Legion Captain [npc=23186] (rare spawn) is found in the Black Legion camp just outside Ashengate in the Direwind Cliffs and also spawns anywhere in the black legion camp near Ashengate not just around one campsite. Kill him.\n2\\. Speak with Fergarin Bardon I 0/1 (Valdeholm)\nYou say, 'Hail, Fergarin Bardon I'\nFergarin thanks you for your help. He assures you that the traitor has been identified and will be dealt with. He mentions that it's interesting that the traitor happened to be a competitor of his as well. 'Such people,' he tells you, 'can never be trusted.' He appears to trust you, however, and suggests that you might be able to help his people deal with a [dangerous threat], if you can find a few friends to help you out.\nYour faction standing with Wraithguard Leadership got better.\nCompleting this task opens up the Kill Kangur [quest=3934] raid.\n**Submitted by:** Jakobe",
